{
    "name": "E2E Upsales - Updated Task trigger",
    "description": "Polling trigger ActivityUpdated reports a to-do closed by the flow, with closeDate among the changed fields.",
    "notes": {
        "d1021767-9353-4b4a-94be-7ea7629fa901": {
            "x": 64,
            "y": 1000,
            "width": 672,
            "height": 240,
            "content": "## Polling trigger with previous values\n\nThe trigger polls every minute and its first tick only records where it starts. The flow waits 2 minutes and creates a to-do (the trigger sees it once, without previous values), waits 90 s so that a tick passes, then closes the to-do. The Condition keeps the closed to-do of this run, and the Assert checks that the trigger knew its earlier values and lists <code>closeDate</code> as changed. AfterAll timeout is 480 s. Do not remove either Wait."
        }
    },
